[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1560","en":"They will embark on a year-long research project in October.","zh":"他们将在十月开始一项为期一年的研究项目。","note":"embark · 上船或飞机； 从事 · embark on","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1561","en":"A prolonged drought could devastate farms throughout the region.","zh":"长期干旱可能会摧毁该地区各地的农场。","note":"devastate · 破坏， 毁坏； 使震惊， 使极为悲痛 · devastate a region","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1562","en":"A little oil helps reduce friction between the moving parts.","zh":"少量润滑油有助于减少活动零件之间的摩擦。","note":"friction · 摩擦； 矛盾， 冲突 · reduce friction","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1563","en":"Her intelligent question prompted the speaker to reconsider his explanation.","zh":"她提出的明智问题促使演讲者重新考虑自己的解释。","note":"intelligent · 聪明的， 理智的 · an intelligent question","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1564","en":"The grant will equip the workshop with new sewing machines.","zh":"这笔拨款将为工作坊配备新缝纫机。","note":"equip · 装备， 配备； 使有能力， 使有准备 · equip with","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1565","en":"The former palace now operates as a luxury hotel.","zh":"昔日的宫殿现在作为一家豪华酒店营业。","note":"luxury · 奢华的；豪华；奢侈 · a luxury hotel","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1566","en":"The mountain holds spiritual significance for many local families.","zh":"这座山对许多当地家庭具有精神意义。","note":"spiritual · 精神的； 心灵的； 宗教的 · spiritual significance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1567","en":"The poet seems to transmute ordinary memories into vivid stories.","zh":"这位诗人似乎把普通的回忆化成了生动的故事。","note":"transmute · 改变； 变化， 变形， 变质 · transmute into","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1568","en":"The hilltop offers a splendid view of the entire bay.","zh":"在山顶可以欣赏到整个海湾的壮丽景色。","note":"splendid · 壮观的， 壮丽的， 极好的； 堂皇的， 豪华的； 灿烂的， 辉煌的 · a splendid view","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1569","en":"We compared the novel with its recent film adaptation.","zh":"我