-10-19:s1579","en":"Some disruption was an inevitable consequence of replacing the railway tracks.","zh":"更换铁轨难免会造成一些干扰。","note":"inevitable · 不可避免的， 必然的 · an inevitable consequence","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1580","en":"The market has become the centre of a vibrant artistic community.","zh":"这个市场已经成为一个充满活力的艺术社群的中心。","note":"vibrant · 振动的； 活泼的， 充满生气的； 兴奋的 · a vibrant community","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1581","en":"She expressed growing frustration with the repeated changes to the schedule.","zh":"她对日程一再变动表达了日益加深的不满。","note":"frustration · 沮丧， 不满 · growing frustration","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1582","en":"The lake provides plenty of opportunities for outdoor recreation.","zh":"这个湖为户外休闲活动提供了很多机会。","note":"recreation · 娱乐， 消遣 · outdoor recreation","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1583","en":"A glass skyscraper now stands where the old cinema once stood.","zh":"原来旧电影院所在的位置如今矗立着一座玻璃摩天楼。","note":"skyscraper · 摩天楼 · a glass skyscraper","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1584","en":"The internship includes a small monthly allowance for travel expenses.","zh":"这份实习包含每月一小笔交通津贴。","note":"allowance · 津贴； 允许， 容忍 · a monthly allowance","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1585","en":"I packed a portable charger for the long train journey.","zh":"我为漫长的火车旅程装上了一个便携式充电器。","note":"portable · 便于携带的； 手提式的 · a portable charger","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1586","en":"Visitors followed a marked path through the ancient ruins.","zh":"游客沿着标示好的小径穿行于古代遗迹之间。","note":"ancient · 古老的； 年老的 · ancient ruins","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1587","en":"We had time to wander through the market before lunch.","zh":"午饭前，我们有时间在市场里闲逛。","note":"wander · 徘徊， 闲逛， 漫步； 偏离正道； 走神， 恍惚 · wander through","recordings":[]},{"id":"catalog:level-up:2026-10-19:s1588","en":"The team decided to adopt a simpler method of recording data.","zh":